type: article
title: "Dark-Medium Response Atlas v0.1.0 — Path, Compensation, Memory, and Observation"
abstract: >-
  A not-peer-reviewed supplemental working paper and methods proposal that
  classifies possible hidden sectors by response, path dependence, parameter
  compensation, phase structure, and observation. Conditional analytic
  derivations and calibration cases are separated from empirical claims.
